# Content-type : text/yaml; charset=ASCII
#
# key format [<toolbox name>/]<toolname>
#
# This is a blacklist of tools which will not have their spatial index
#      deleted prior to tool execution and then re-created after execution
#      Currently we are only acting upon data within a Mobile Database (.geodatabase)
#

#  Data Management Tools:
- data management tools/addspatialindex
- data management tools/removespatialindex
- data management tools/registerwithgeodatabase